<div class="vac-age-tuple" data-live><b>P7 · 22.00</b><span data-status>Live tuple · insertion XID not yet frozen</span><small>No dead version in this example</small></div>
<div class="vac-age-clock" data-live><p>Transactions consumed since the table’s frozen boundary</p><strong data-age>20 million</strong><div class="vac-age-track" aria-hidden="true"><span data-age-bar></span></div><p class="vac-age-scale">0 <span>200 million · illustrative forced-vacuum setting</span></p></div>
<div class="vac-maps" data-live><p>Business price <b>Unchanged · 22.00</b></p><p>All-frozen page <b data-frozen>No</b></p></div>
